OL,3,GNEWSAHeartbroken Dolly Parton tribute
OL,4,Aact vows to continue
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe star of a Dolly Parton tribute act
OL,7,Fhas vowed to continue for the rest of
OL,8,Fher life following the country music
OL,9,Fstar's death.
OL,11,FSarah Jayne Crust, who lives in Ashford
OL,12,Fand has performed as Parton for 32
OL,13,Fyears, said she was "heartbroken" and
OL,14,Fhad not yet come to terms with the
OL,15,Fnews.
OL,17,FParton died on Tuesday, aged 80, after
OL,18,F"a brief battle with cancer", her team
OL,19,Fsaid in a statement to CBS, the BBC's
OL,20,FUS partner.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
